{"step_index":1267,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-05T06:39:14Z","input_tokens":8961,"cache_read_tokens":120075,"output_tokens":657,"thinking":"The boot process involves an autoboot sequence. It appears the system attempts to save the environment. Checking the boot command and the saving environment might provide a clue. The sequence suggests a potential issue within the initial boot-up configuration or environment saving.\n\n\nThe system logs show a boot sequence with a custom command, `bootsys`, executed before the standard autoboot process. Investigating this custom command, it is found within ZTE's U-Boot version. The flash image might have overwritten the original bootloader with the `bootloader.img` file, possibly changing the expected boot sequence.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":100,"Path":"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\xview\\normal\\B866V2-FlashATV12 - Evoca.bat","StartLine":1}}]}
{"step_index":1268,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-05T06:39:27Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-05T00:39:27-06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-05T00:39:27-06:00\nShowing lines 1-78 of 78\n1: @echo off\n2: setlocal ENABLEDELAYEDEXPANSION\n3: title ZTE-B866V2-OS12 [EVOCA SIN TTL - SALTO AUTOMATICO FASTBOOTD -> FASTBOOT]\n4: chcp 65001 >nul\n5: cls\n6: cd /d \"%~dp0B866V2\"\n7: \n8: echo ============================================================================\n9: echo   ZTE B866V2 ANDROID 12 - EVOCA (100%% EXTERNO SIN TTL / ANTI-WATCHDOG)\n10: echo ============================================================================\n11: echo [*] Si tu TV ya esta en la pantalla \"fastbootd\":\n12: echo     -> Selecciona \"Reboot to bootloader\" en la TV (con control o teclado USB),\n13: echo     -> O desconecta la corriente estando en \"fastbootd\", manten RESET y conecta.\n14: echo        (Como fastbootd ya activo otg_device=1, encendera el USB sin usar TTL).\n15: echo [*] Esperando conexion USB de la caja (fastbootd o fastboot)...\n16: \n17: :WAIT_FASTBOOT\n18: fastboot devices | findstr /i \"fastboot\" >nul\n19: if errorlevel 1 (\n20:     goto WAIT_FASTBOOT\n21: )\n22: \n23: REM Verificar si la caja entro en fastbootd (PID_4EE7 / is-userspace: yes) para hacer el salto sin TTL\n24: fastboot getvar is-userspace 2>&1 | findstr /i \"yes\" >nul\n25: if not errorlevel 1 (\n26:     echo [+] Pantalla fastbootd detectada por USB! Ejecutando salto automatico a Bootloader ^(sin TTL^)...\n27:     fastboot reboot bootloader\n28:     timeout /t 2 /nobreak >nul\n29:     goto WAIT_FASTBOOT\n30: )\n31: \n32: echo [+] Caja conectada en U-Boot Fastboot! Ejecutando secuencia EVOCA...\n33: fastboot oem \"watchdog off\"\n34: fastboot oem 'setenv lock 10100000;save\n35: fastboot oem \"setenv lock 10100000;save\"\n36: fastboot oem \"setenv otg_device 1;save\"\n37: fastboot flashing unlock_critical\n38: fastboot flashing unlock\n39: fastboot oem \"saveenv\"\n40: fastboot reboot bootloader\n41: \n42: :WAIT_REBOOT_BL\n43: fastboot devices | findstr /i \"fastboot\" >nul\n44: if errorlevel 1 (\n45:     goto WAIT_REBOOT_BL\n46: )\n47: \n48: fastboot oem \"watchdog off\"\n49: fastboot oem 'setenv lock 10100000;save\n50: fastboot getvar unlocked\n51: \n52: echo [*] Inyectando Firmware Android 12 Liberado ^(protegiendo Widevine L1 y MAC/SN^)...\n53: fastboot flash boot boot.img\n54: fastboot flash bootloader bootloader.img\n55: fastboot flash _aml_dtb dtb.img\n56: fastboot flash dtbo dtbo.img\n57: REM SE OMITE factory.img y cri_data.img PARA NO BORRAR CLAVES DRM WIDEVINE L1 NI MAC/SN\n58: fastboot flash logo logo.img\n59: fastboot flash param param.img\n60: fastboot flash conf conf.img\n61: fastboot flash oem oem.img\n62: fastboot flash super super.img\n63: fastboot flash vbmeta vbmeta.img\n64: fastboot flash recovery recovery.img\n65: if exist \"..\\..\\..\\experimento\\11_VALIDACION_OTA_Y_FIRMWARE_ZTE\\cache_ext4.img\" (\n66:     fastboot flash cache \"..\\..\\..\\experimento\\11_VALIDACION_OTA_Y_FIRMWARE_ZTE\\cache_ext4.img\"\n67: ) else (\n68:     fastboot erase cache\n69: )\n70: fastboot erase userdata\n71: \n72: echo ============================================================================\n73: echo [+] ¡EXITO TOTAL! RETENIENDO CAJA EN FASTBOOT ^(ANTI-WATCHDOG ACTIVO^)\n74: echo ============================================================================\n75: :KEEP_ALIVE\n76: fastboot getvar version >nul 2>&1\n77: timeout /t 2 /nobreak >nul\n78: goto KEEP_ALIVE"}
